              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What does the Telugu goodbye literally promise, and how do you answer? (\"I'll go and come back\"; reply veḷḷi raṇḍi, \"go and come back\".)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
